SUMMARY:ASUCD Pride Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate pride\, student leadership\, and community at the ASUCD Pride Festival 2026\, a dynamic\, student-driven event on campus. This year\, ASUCD is hosting Pride on May 29th\, from 12-9 pm\, at the Memorial Union Quad. \n  \nOrganized by Associated Students of UC Davis (ASUCD)\, this festival is one rooted in amplifying LGBTQIA+ voices and creating inclusive spaces led by students\, for students. Join ASUCD for live music\, performances\, craft and food vendors\, teach-ins\, and so much more. Resource booths and interactive activities will be included! \n  \nThe event is open and free for all! \n  \nFor volunteer opportunities\, more information\, and questions\, visit the ASUCD Pride Festival Instagram.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/asucd-pride-festival/
LOCATION:UC Davis Quad\, 1 Shields Avenue\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Pride-Festival-Vendor-Image-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
